    {
      "title": "New Ported God",
      "anchor": "New_Ported_God",
      "level": 2,
      "subsections": [
        {
          "title": "Artio",
          "anchor": "Artio",
          "level": 3,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "General"
            },
            {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ranged Basic Attacks in Druid Stance"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Melee Basic Attacks in Bear Stance"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Damage Type: Magical"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Scaling Type: Intelligence & Strength Scaling"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Passive: Decompose"
            },
            {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "When Artio hits enemy Gods with damaging abilities, the target will begin to decompose, decreasing physical and magical protections and reducing their healing."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Ability 1: Energy Surge / Maul Prey"
            },
            {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Druid: Energy Surge",
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "text": "Artio pulses out a strong wave of energy dealing Magical damage to enemies. She will heal herself and allies around each enemy god hit by this ability."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": "Bear: Maul Prey",
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "text": "Artio swipes twice in front of her with her claws, dealing magical damage to enemies with each swipe."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Ability 2: Entangling Vines / Ferocious Roar"
            },
            {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Druid: Entangling Vines",
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "text": "Artio creates a thicket of vines around herself that cripples enemy Gods and decreases their magical or physical power as long as they are in the area."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bear: Ferocious Bear",
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "text": "Artio lets out a ferocious roar that stuns all nearby enemies and increases her own physical and magical protections."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Ability 3: Life Tap / Heavy Charge"
            },
            {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Druid: Life Tap",
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "text": "Artio channels, draining the life from enemies in a line in front of her."
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Enemies hit gain a stacking slow. If hit 5 times, targets are rooted."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": "Bear: Heavy Charge",
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "text": "Artio charges forward with increased movement speed. Enemies she charges through take damage and are slowed. Ultimate Ability: Shapeshift"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Ultimate Ability: Shapeshift"
            },
            {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Artio Shapeshifts between her Druid stance and Bear stance.",
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "text": "When Artio hits an enemy with an ability, she gains one stack of Invigoration. Granting movement speed and mana regeneration."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Aspect releasing 5th December"
            },
            {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Aspect of the Denmother",
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "text": "Artio can only change stances inside the fountain. Upon leaving the fountain, her abilities are enhanced and her ultimate changes based on her form."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "New Wandering Market Travelers",
      "anchor": "New_Wandering_Market_Travelers",
      "level": 2,
      "subsections": [
        {
          "title": "Traveler Name - Knights of Osiris",
          "anchor": "Traveler_Name_-_Knights_of_Osiris",
          "level": 3,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Behold! The Knights of Osiris are here - libs optional. “Tis but a scratch! Courage, honor and a questionable rabbit await"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Contents"
            },
            {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Noble Knight Osiris Skin - Instantly unlocked after purchasing the Premium Traveler Page"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Black Knight Osiris Skin - Instantly unlocked after purchasing the Premium Traveler Page"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Peppermint Candy - Instantly unlocked after purchasing the Premium Traveler Page"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Premium Page Contents - Unlock the following items with Wandering Market Coins",
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "text": "Noble Knight - Golden Word Prism"
