        {
          "title": "Traveler Name - Polar Prankster Danzaburou",
          "anchor": "Traveler_Name_-_Polar_Prankster_Danzaburou",
          "level": 3,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Chances are, if a snowball hits you this winter, Danzaburou is behind it. Celebrate the season with the bear-y cool skin!"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Contents"
            },
            {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
