          "anchor": "Traveler_Name_-_Mystic_Guardian_Athena",
          "level": 3,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "A celestial guardian descends from the stars!"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Added a new Traveler for Mystic Guardian Athena. If you own ANY of the Mystic Guardian prisms you will instantly unlock the Premium Traveler Page."
